t!", "summary": "Rave Rough is a comedic and chaotic puzzle platformer about chucking your exposable vinyl collection to bounce your way throughout many platforming challenges! All the while butting heads with wacky friends and foes! Levels are very open ended and the moveset compliments this, with you having a lot of freedom to tackle challenges in all sorts of different ways.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/whats-left-of-rave-rough", "videos": [{"id": 125924, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "_SeWG7TY-AM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_SeWG7TY-AM", "title": "RAVE ROUGH - SAGE 2024 TRAILER", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_SeWG7TY-AM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 132939, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "RQTywZLE56k", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RQTywZLE56k", "title": "RAVE ROUGH ARCINDIE RELEASE TRAILER", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RQTywZLE56k/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 184294, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "CoXWUYkSXC4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CoXWUYkSXC4", "title": "WHAT'S LEFT OF RAVE ROUGH", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CoXWUYkSXC4/fhddefault.jpg"}]}